      "writtenOn": "2021-11-11T01:00:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do we need to define this. Are the checks in vk_mem_alloc.h not good enough for setting this correctly? Like is it the case that even if we\u0027re using the compiler that passes the checks, the libraries are still not present? https://github.com/GPUOpen-LibrariesAndSDKs/VulkanMemoryAllocator/blob/master/include/vk_mem_alloc.h#L2445",
